# 1. Executive Summary

An API Security Risk Analysis was conducted on the JSONPlaceholder public testing API using Postman on Kali Linux. The objective was to identify common API security risks through read-only testing and documentation review.

The assessment focused on authentication, authorization, data exposure, and API security best practices. No exploitation attempts were performed during testing.

