### Target API

https://jsonplaceholder.typicode.com

### Testing Type

Read-Only Security Assessment

### Environment

* Kali Linux Virtual Machine
* Postman
* Web Browser

### Out of Scope

* Exploitation attempts
* Denial of Service testing
* Authentication bypass
* Any destructive activity

